    "_about": "THE GEMSBOK (2026-11-05, 2nd pass): a stocky antelope on the deer frame, a gemsbok's height (1.2 m) -- grey-fawn on a thick neck; the black: a broad band from the elbow along the lower flank over the white belly to the stifle and down the front of the thigh, a patch atop each foreleg, a line down the spine from the nape, a line down the throat, a patch on the thigh, garters high on the legs, white below with black knee patches; the white face boldly masked (a blaze from the horns to the nose, a stripe down through each eye to the cheek, a strap under the chin); broad rounded ears; the long straight horns and a long black tail to the hocks (2026-11-08) The HORNS are the engine's sharp `horn` (sharp.js; tools/creaturegen/sharp/horns.py merged the field part and its slender detail tip into one centreline): smooth, sunk in the skull, a true point. (2026-11-08, ears2.py) The EARS (ears2.py): broad round-tipped cupped sheets (sharp.js `fin`), pale in the hollow; the roots faired.",
